Data note: exchange rates captured by this project originate from Wing Bank
Cambodia's public exchange-rate page (https://www.wingbank.com.kh/en/exchange-rate)
and remain the property of Wing Bank. They are indicative, may change without
notice, and are redistributed here for personal/informational tracking only.
